WEBVTT

01:47.960 --> 01:48.640
Hey, Hao.

01:49.280 --> 01:50.960
Is there a girl named Qing Ye

01:51.120 --> 01:51.880
in your hotel?

01:53.800 --> 01:54.440
She checked into

01:55.200 --> 01:56.039
the ocean-view suite.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.600
Do me a favour and look after her.

01:58.440 --> 01:59.440
Let me know if anything happens.

02:00.880 --> 02:01.280
Alright.

02:02.000 --> 02:02.600
Thanks!

02:13.720 --> 02:14.680
What! What's wrong with you?

02:16.840 --> 02:17.320
Hello?

02:18.360 --> 02:19.280
Your room

02:19.560 --> 02:20.680
has been vacant for a long time.

02:20.880 --> 02:22.040
Equipment issues are normal.

02:22.440 --> 02:23.240
Bro,

02:23.800 --> 02:25.040
I need to download study materials.

02:25.040 --> 02:26.600
I can't work without Wi-Fi.

02:26.880 --> 02:28.160
[Just use your phone data.]

02:29.520 --> 02:30.560
The files are huge!

02:30.560 --> 02:32.000
The phone's data is too slow for this.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.320
[Hey! Come on!]

02:33.400 --> 02:34.040
[It's too late]

02:34.040 --> 02:35.000
[and raining so hard.]

02:35.360 --> 02:36.240
[The guy repairing the Wi-Fi]

02:36.240 --> 02:37.400
[won't come until tomorrow.]

02:39.600 --> 02:40.440
But what about tonight?

02:40.720 --> 02:41.600
I can give you the password

02:41.600 --> 02:42.520
for the room next door.

02:42.600 --> 02:43.680
[Just use his Wi-Fi for now.]

02:46.240 --> 02:47.160
But how about the air conditioner?

02:47.520 --> 02:48.280
[That guy]

02:48.280 --> 02:49.520
[also comes tomorrow, ok?]

02:52.079 --> 02:52.760
Fine.

03:10.720 --> 03:11.720
Hi everyone,

03:12.560 --> 03:13.520
welcome to

03:13.520 --> 03:14.880
"Awesome' livestream."

03:15.560 --> 03:16.520
Today I'm gonna show you

03:16.520 --> 03:17.360
some real talent.

03:18.079 --> 03:19.880
You've never seen anything like this!

03:20.400 --> 03:21.840
It can knock your socks off.

03:22.000 --> 03:23.760
New friends here

03:24.079 --> 03:25.920
don't forget to hit the follow button!

03:27.640 --> 03:29.079
Hello, "No Cilantro."

03:29.760 --> 03:31.280
Hi, "Little Grass".

03:35.440 --> 03:36.640
I'll sing a song,

03:36.800 --> 03:37.600
and dance for you.

03:38.040 --> 03:38.800
Hey, come on.

03:38.800 --> 03:39.960
Hit that like button!

03:50.440 --> 03:50.960
Wu.

03:52.079 --> 03:53.200
The camera is fine.

03:53.320 --> 03:54.079
It's just the network lagging.

03:55.440 --> 03:56.160
So early in the morning?

03:56.920 --> 03:57.640
The Sun just came up.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.640
Do you know that girl

04:01.920 --> 04:02.640
in that ocean-view suite?

04:03.880 --> 04:04.920
Why were you rushing

04:04.920 --> 04:05.320
to find her last night?

04:06.160 --> 04:06.720
A client.

04:07.320 --> 04:08.800
Tough clients like that

04:09.640 --> 04:10.440
aren't easy to deal with.

04:11.640 --> 04:12.400
I heard

04:13.080 --> 04:14.240
that you need money recently.

04:14.440 --> 04:15.160
When have I ever

04:15.160 --> 04:16.200
had money to spare?

04:17.279 --> 04:17.760
What?

04:18.440 --> 04:19.240
Got a job for me?

04:19.680 --> 04:20.160
Yes.

04:21.120 --> 04:21.640
Are you interested?

04:21.720 --> 04:22.520
If it pays, I'm in.

04:22.840 --> 04:23.440
The more, the better.

04:24.520 --> 04:25.360
Then do you want something

04:25.360 --> 04:26.080
that makes quick cash?

04:30.320 --> 04:31.040
How quick?

04:34.000 --> 04:34.760
Call this number.

04:35.280 --> 04:36.040
You are guaranteed

04:36.440 --> 04:37.120
almost 2,000 a day.

04:42.920 --> 04:43.800
I can't do this job.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.240
But why?

04:45.680 --> 04:46.440
I know this guy.

04:46.800 --> 04:48.200
He deals in stolen goods.

04:48.760 --> 04:49.400
I won't earn

04:49.880 --> 04:50.440
that kind of money.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.320
Money is money.

04:53.120 --> 04:53.960
Who cares where it comes from?

04:54.400 --> 04:55.200
You know what they say,

04:55.360 --> 04:56.440
"Clean money

04:57.040 --> 04:57.920
lets you sleep tight at night."

04:58.640 --> 04:59.440
Who said this?

05:00.120 --> 05:01.200
Zhou Guimei, a philosopher.

05:02.320 --> 05:03.200
But who is that?

05:05.800 --> 05:06.520
Not telling you.

05:07.880 --> 05:08.440
It's fixed now.

05:09.280 --> 05:09.840
Fixed?

05:17.000 --> 05:19.200
Thanks for the "yacht" from Love Baby.

05:19.440 --> 05:20.040
Thank you.

05:20.440 --> 05:21.600
Thank you for your gifts.

05:21.600 --> 05:23.000
Thanks! You are so generous!

05:23.240 --> 05:23.840
Awesome!

05:23.880 --> 05:24.640
Thanks.

05:26.080 --> 05:26.920
Who the hell are you?

05:29.000 --> 05:30.280
Can you keep it down?

05:31.600 --> 05:32.240
What did you say?

05:32.360 --> 05:34.200
I said, turn it down!

05:34.640 --> 05:35.640
Then come in and adjust it yourself.

05:35.680 --> 05:36.240
Here, come in!

05:36.240 --> 05:36.640
Me?

05:36.680 --> 05:37.400
Yeah, you. Show me

05:37.400 --> 05:38.080
how to

05:38.080 --> 05:38.840
"turn it down?"

05:38.880 --> 05:40.320
Let go, or I'm calling for help!

05:40.360 --> 05:40.960
Get off me!

05:41.440 --> 05:42.440
Easy, man, easy.

05:43.680 --> 05:44.400
She is my cousin.

05:44.400 --> 05:45.520
Spoiled at home.

05:45.800 --> 05:46.800
She may be a bit picky,

05:47.040 --> 05:47.760
a bit mean

05:48.240 --> 05:49.000
and has a bad temper.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.600
Please don't mind it.

05:51.560 --> 05:52.640
Your cousin?

05:52.880 --> 05:53.159
Yes.

05:53.159 --> 05:54.159
How do you discipline her like this?

05:54.320 --> 05:55.440
Early in the morning, banging on my door,

05:55.520 --> 05:56.159
yelling at me

05:56.440 --> 05:57.440
and asking me to keep quiet?

05:58.080 --> 05:58.560
I'm sorry for this.

05:59.000 --> 06:00.440
She's got severe sleep issues.

06:00.640 --> 06:01.800
Normally she yells at me

06:01.880 --> 06:02.760
if there's any noise.

06:02.960 --> 06:03.760
I wasn't here this morning,

06:03.880 --> 06:04.600
so she went at you instead.

06:05.200 --> 06:06.800
Really sorry about that.

06:07.520 --> 06:08.520
I'll let her go for your sake.

06:08.920 --> 06:09.680
But watch it next time.

06:14.440 --> 06:15.280
How am I picky?

06:15.920 --> 06:16.720
No, you are not.

06:17.040 --> 06:18.240
Just mind your own business next time.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.080
How is it none of my business?

06:21.520 --> 06:23.080
You think you know my grandma better than me?

06:25.320 --> 06:27.200
You mean the food I've ordered?

06:28.240 --> 06:29.240
Who knows that your portions here

06:29.240 --> 06:29.800
are way too big?

06:30.400 --> 06:31.360
I couldn't finish it by myself,

06:31.560 --> 06:32.520
so I shared with her.

06:35.080 --> 06:36.120
Why are you here?

06:37.240 --> 06:38.080
To fix the Wi-Fi.

06:39.760 --> 06:41.040
You're the guy to repair Wi-Fi?

06:43.960 --> 06:45.240
I heard that you

06:45.440 --> 06:46.520
had a rough night yesterday?

06:48.920 --> 06:49.600
Not at all!

06:50.280 --> 06:52.240
At least the air conditioner works here.

06:52.680 --> 06:53.640
It's better than life at Xuan Island.

07:04.560 --> 07:05.360
Well,

07:06.440 --> 07:07.200
I'm also here

07:07.880 --> 07:08.520
to repair the air conditioner.

07:17.240 --> 07:17.800
Hello,

07:18.920 --> 07:19.800
are you extending your stay?

07:20.040 --> 07:20.600
Yes.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.960
Ok, the scan didn't go through.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.000
Scan again, please.

07:41.200 --> 07:42.720
Let me handle it first.

07:42.880 --> 07:43.360
Ok.

07:58.200 --> 07:58.840
[Mr. Sun,]

07:59.159 --> 07:59.760
[if you see this,]

07:59.800 --> 08:00.960
[text me back please.]

08:01.240 --> 08:01.960
[Quite urgent.]

08:12.560 --> 08:13.080
I thought

08:13.080 --> 08:14.240
that our generous princess

08:14.600 --> 08:15.560
had endless cash to burn.

08:18.120 --> 08:19.000
I gave you the room fee.

08:19.280 --> 08:20.640
It's up to you if you stay.

08:28.120 --> 08:29.000
The air conditioner is all set.

08:30.520 --> 08:31.760
The guy next door is a long-term tenant.

08:32.159 --> 08:34.159
If you love his stream, just enjoy it.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.080
Hey guys,

08:36.200 --> 08:37.320
how is my singing?

08:37.919 --> 08:39.080
Thank you for your gift.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.039
Thank you, "My Sky".

08:40.280 --> 08:41.360
Thanks, you are so nice!

08:41.520 --> 08:42.000
Then...

08:42.039 --> 08:43.080
keep those yachts coming!

08:43.120 --> 08:43.640
Will you still extend?

08:43.640 --> 08:44.159
Thanks.

08:45.040 --> 08:45.600
No, I'm leaving.

09:08.800 --> 09:10.280
How did you end up here?

09:11.600 --> 09:13.040
Where's your home?

09:15.080 --> 09:16.560
Are you homeless like me?

09:18.440 --> 09:19.080
Let me see.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.200
What's your name?

09:20.800 --> 09:22.200
You've got a tag.

09:22.320 --> 09:23.680
Tata, is it your name?

09:24.800 --> 09:26.200
Hello, Tata,

09:29.760 --> 09:31.320
where is your home?

09:32.800 --> 09:33.440
Tata,

09:35.160 --> 09:36.560
I told you not to run off.

09:37.880 --> 09:38.800
It's pouring out there.

09:39.040 --> 09:39.840
What if you got lost?

09:42.040 --> 09:42.720
Is it your kitty?

09:44.280 --> 09:44.760
Let's go.

09:44.920 --> 09:46.000
I'll take you to find your mom.

10:02.120 --> 10:02.760
Out here,

10:02.920 --> 10:04.440
turn left, walk 500 meters to the bus.

10:05.160 --> 10:06.280
Just three stops to Xuan Island.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.040
Stop nagging.

10:36.800 --> 10:37.440
Thank you.

10:37.520 --> 10:38.040
You're welcome.

11:06.040 --> 11:06.600
Hello.

11:07.520 --> 11:09.400
Ye, you've called me?

11:09.880 --> 11:10.680
I was busy then.

11:11.400 --> 11:12.200
Mr. Sun,

11:12.560 --> 11:14.320
my bank card is frozen.

11:14.880 --> 11:15.720
is there anything wrong

11:15.720 --> 11:17.080
with my dad?

11:18.120 --> 11:19.760
The case is pretty messy.

11:20.000 --> 11:20.720
But it's just part of

11:20.720 --> 11:21.840
normal investigation.

11:22.280 --> 11:23.240
Don't worry.

11:25.760 --> 11:26.680
I see.

11:27.520 --> 11:28.960
I transferred you some money.

11:29.560 --> 11:30.680
Let me know if you need more.

11:31.160 --> 11:31.800
Ok.

11:33.040 --> 11:35.280
Sorry to bother you.

12:10.680 --> 12:11.320
Auntie.

12:12.520 --> 12:14.080
Why do you come from outside?

12:15.560 --> 12:16.200
I...

12:16.640 --> 12:17.960
I just went out for a walk.

12:18.560 --> 12:19.400
A walk?

12:19.560 --> 12:20.960
With a suitcase?

12:23.640 --> 12:24.560
Strength training.

12:26.520 --> 12:26.880
Oh!

12:28.720 --> 12:29.200
This.

12:29.640 --> 12:30.280
Just take it.

12:32.760 --> 12:35.040
Just keep it, okay?

12:35.520 --> 12:36.520
Wu said that

12:36.840 --> 12:38.560
you shouldn't have to pay for the lock.

12:38.920 --> 12:40.320
And you've already given us money.

12:40.560 --> 12:41.920
We can't take another cent

12:41.960 --> 12:43.320
for your room and board here.

12:43.640 --> 12:45.120
Otherwise he'll argue with me again.

12:46.000 --> 12:46.520
Here,

12:48.360 --> 12:49.360
I made some Zongzi with red beans.

12:49.920 --> 12:50.680
Try one?

12:52.200 --> 12:52.760
Oh, I'm not hungry.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.240
I may not have one.

12:54.320 --> 12:54.720
Wait,

12:54.920 --> 12:56.960
it's not made with lard.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.640
Wu had replaced it with vegetable oil.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.840
Really, it's just for you.

13:00.920 --> 13:02.560
Just give it a try.

13:04.960 --> 13:06.240
Here, try it.

13:20.520 --> 13:21.640
Actually it tastes good.

13:21.760 --> 13:22.400
Told you so!

13:22.560 --> 13:23.840
I knew you'd like it.

13:24.720 --> 13:25.640
I'll also have a try.

13:28.840 --> 13:29.440
Auntie.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.920
I'm sorry for harsh things I said yesterday.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.520
Please don't take it to heart.

13:34.000 --> 13:34.840
You know,

13:35.280 --> 13:36.560
lard and vegetable oil

13:36.560 --> 13:38.360
really have different flavors.

13:39.920 --> 13:40.800
What did you just say?

13:40.840 --> 13:42.080
What... what about?

13:44.560 --> 13:45.160
Never mind.

13:46.000 --> 13:46.560
Yummy.

13:47.200 --> 13:48.400
See? I agree.

13:48.840 --> 13:49.760
Then I'll go back to my room.

13:50.320 --> 13:50.960
Here, here,

13:51.760 --> 13:52.520
take one more.

13:53.720 --> 13:54.840
Take a big piece.

13:55.280 --> 13:55.720
Alright.

13:56.960 --> 13:57.680
Eat up.

13:58.360 --> 13:59.000
Then I go upstairs.

13:59.040 --> 13:59.520
Ok.

14:07.760 --> 14:08.880
Where's my laptop bag?

14:09.720 --> 14:10.640
What laptop bag?

14:11.840 --> 14:12.320
Hold on.

14:12.320 --> 14:13.120
I was carrying two bags all the time.

14:13.120 --> 14:14.600
A black one and a pink one.

14:15.040 --> 14:15.800
I haven't seen

14:15.800 --> 14:16.760
that pink one.

14:18.280 --> 14:19.120
What's wrong?

14:22.200 --> 14:22.880
Ye...

14:35.120 --> 14:35.720
Zhang,

14:37.240 --> 14:38.040
it's me,

14:38.760 --> 14:39.720
Fangfang in Xuan Island.

14:40.960 --> 14:41.920
Your mother is a regular visitor

14:41.920 --> 14:43.120
here for haircuts.

14:50.360 --> 14:51.080
Look,

14:51.320 --> 14:52.640
my niece

14:52.720 --> 14:53.440
left her laptop

14:53.440 --> 14:54.680
on the bus.

14:54.920 --> 14:55.320
Yes.

14:55.560 --> 14:57.720
Can you help us to find it?

15:01.080 --> 15:01.760
Okay, okay.

15:02.040 --> 15:02.840
I got it.

15:03.000 --> 15:03.360
Alright.

15:03.400 --> 15:04.400
And tell your mom

15:04.400 --> 15:05.240
next time she comes for a perm,

15:05.280 --> 15:06.320
I'll give her 20% off.

15:06.840 --> 15:07.360
Bye.

15:09.680 --> 15:10.520
Not much hope.

15:12.600 --> 15:14.160
I'll file a report at the station then,

15:14.360 --> 15:15.240
see if the police

15:15.480 --> 15:16.520
can show me the footage.

15:18.520 --> 15:20.160
Don't get your hopes up.

15:20.720 --> 15:21.440
What do you mean?

15:22.440 --> 15:23.520
A laptop like yours,

15:23.560 --> 15:24.200
is a rare item

15:24.200 --> 15:25.000
in the whole Zhazhating.

15:25.440 --> 15:26.880
If it is stolen, it's either

15:27.000 --> 15:27.880
someone keeps it,

15:28.200 --> 15:29.160
or they sell it.

15:30.000 --> 15:30.840
But that laptop

15:30.840 --> 15:32.720
has all my important files.

15:33.000 --> 15:34.360
I have to get it back.

15:35.640 --> 15:36.200
Wu,

15:36.600 --> 15:37.720
you know a lot of people,

15:37.840 --> 15:38.560
and you are well-connected.

15:38.880 --> 15:40.800
Why don't you help look for it?

15:41.080 --> 15:42.680
Might work better than the police.

15:48.520 --> 15:49.960
If you don't want to help, fine.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.320
I'll go to the police myself.

15:54.160 --> 15:55.560
I'll come with you.

15:55.840 --> 15:57.000
You don't know the way around here.

15:57.320 --> 15:58.000
Ye...

16:01.680 --> 16:02.400
"Call this number.

16:04.400 --> 16:05.120
You are guaranteed.

16:05.520 --> 16:06.160
almost 2,000 a day."

16:12.400 --> 16:12.880
Hello?

16:17.440 --> 16:17.960
Right, got it.

16:18.520 --> 16:19.320
Thanks for the help.

16:23.320 --> 16:24.640
Officer Xu, any good news?

16:25.080 --> 16:25.920
Have a seat first. Here.

16:26.640 --> 16:28.360
Is here the public security

16:28.440 --> 16:29.440
so poor?

16:29.560 --> 16:30.560
Step out and

16:30.560 --> 16:31.200
lose our laptop?

16:31.400 --> 16:32.320
I want to see

16:32.320 --> 16:33.640
who this little bastard is.

16:33.680 --> 16:34.720
Don't worry.

16:34.720 --> 16:35.920
Just sit down first.

16:36.160 --> 16:38.040
That laptop is too expensive.

16:38.080 --> 16:38.640
I can't just sit and rest.

16:39.400 --> 16:40.240
We have understood

16:40.280 --> 16:41.240
your situation.

16:41.640 --> 16:42.200
I just

16:42.240 --> 16:42.720
called

16:42.720 --> 16:43.680
the bus company

16:43.840 --> 16:45.640
to send us the interior footage

16:45.640 --> 16:46.680
from that period.

16:47.520 --> 16:48.960
But it's a massive file,

16:49.200 --> 16:50.360
so it takes time.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.440
Well,

16:54.520 --> 16:55.120
how about this?

16:55.880 --> 16:57.120
Auntie, you go back to the shop.

16:57.400 --> 16:58.360
I'll wait here.

16:59.560 --> 17:00.800
Perfect.

17:02.000 --> 17:02.880
Thanks, Officer Xu.

17:03.000 --> 17:03.520
You are welcome.

17:03.720 --> 17:04.160
Bye.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.119
Then come with me.

17:23.280 --> 17:23.920
I'm here now.

17:24.359 --> 17:25.000
Where are you?

17:26.079 --> 17:27.200
Go straight ahead,

17:27.520 --> 17:28.200
and there's a blue door.

17:28.520 --> 17:30.200
Honk twice when you get there.

17:46.520 --> 17:47.520
Are you Xing Wu?

17:49.520 --> 17:50.040
Yes.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.360
I've heard a lot about you.

17:58.120 --> 17:59.440
Do you and Cao Ping have a beef?

18:14.880 --> 18:16.280
Does that matter for the job?

18:20.200 --> 18:20.680
Fair enough.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.720
You two can settle it

18:22.840 --> 18:24.200
when he gets out.

18:25.920 --> 18:26.440
Come in.

18:52.280 --> 18:53.360
Yeah, that's him.

18:58.120 --> 18:59.880
But he's covering his face. We can't tell.

19:01.720 --> 19:02.880
Looks like a prolific thief.

19:03.680 --> 19:04.640
He didn't show his face at all.

19:07.440 --> 19:08.640
Can we find it back?

19:08.800 --> 19:09.520
We'll try our best.

19:10.120 --> 19:11.720
Well, thank you.

19:18.760 --> 19:19.360
So, what do you think?

19:20.080 --> 19:21.040
Nice place, huh?

19:21.720 --> 19:22.520
What do you think of

19:23.520 --> 19:24.160
my business?

19:25.360 --> 19:26.160
Do you like it?

19:37.160 --> 19:38.720
Can you even handle so much inventory?

19:39.200 --> 19:40.520
Not really.

19:40.520 --> 19:41.880
That's why I need people.

19:48.880 --> 19:49.400
Buddy,

19:50.280 --> 19:52.400
how long does it take you

19:52.400 --> 19:53.040
to swap a phone battery?

19:54.520 --> 19:55.120
About 5 minutes.

19:55.600 --> 19:56.320
5 minutes?

19:56.680 --> 19:57.120
You...

20:03.120 --> 20:04.120
show me in 5 minutes.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.560
Nice, bro.

20:52.920 --> 20:54.080
You're faster than

20:54.120 --> 20:55.400
my two techs work together.

20:56.560 --> 20:57.360
I heard that

20:57.920 --> 20:59.080
you have something harder,

21:00.120 --> 21:01.000
and pay more for it.

21:02.960 --> 21:03.760
Wanna make money?

21:06.000 --> 21:06.440
Yeah.

21:06.840 --> 21:07.440
Straight to the point.

21:07.960 --> 21:08.920
Let's make it more challenging.

21:09.720 --> 21:10.160
Here.

21:12.000 --> 21:12.600
Come here.

21:19.000 --> 21:20.240
Fresh ones,

21:20.560 --> 21:21.760
wipe the data and reflash.

21:22.000 --> 21:24.000
Scuffed ones, part them out.

21:24.960 --> 21:25.920
Paid per piece.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.920
You certainly seem to know your stuff.

21:33.520 --> 21:34.440
Just bought these in.

21:35.520 --> 21:36.400
Wipe the ID,

21:36.560 --> 21:37.720
flash it, and sell it as new.

21:41.200 --> 21:42.280
Are these stuff legit?

21:44.160 --> 21:45.960
Just mind your own business.

21:46.160 --> 21:47.560
You'll get paid.

21:51.880 --> 21:52.520
Gang,

21:53.160 --> 21:54.040
I'm a coward.

21:54.880 --> 21:56.320
If it's illegal,

21:56.960 --> 21:57.680
I can't join you.

21:58.120 --> 21:58.720
How about this?

21:59.520 --> 22:00.000
Today,

22:00.440 --> 22:01.520
I just come here to make a deal.

22:03.200 --> 22:03.920
What?

22:05.000 --> 22:05.760
I'll take this.

22:06.520 --> 22:07.280
Name your price.

22:12.040 --> 22:12.520
Ok,

22:14.280 --> 22:14.960
16,000.

22:17.160 --> 22:19.040
If you can afford it, you can take it.

22:20.200 --> 22:21.200
You bought this for

22:21.200 --> 22:22.400
less than 2,000.

22:22.880 --> 22:24.440
Now you're quoting me retail price?

22:25.120 --> 22:26.240
Am I an idiot?

22:26.560 --> 22:27.200
Xing Wu,

22:28.560 --> 22:29.920
are you looking for trouble here?

22:33.640 --> 22:34.320
I'm telling you,

22:34.720 --> 22:35.840
if you can't afford it,

22:35.920 --> 22:38.240
neither you nor the laptop leaves this room.

22:41.520 --> 22:42.720
What if I walk out anyway?

22:45.400 --> 22:46.440
Then let's see

22:46.960 --> 22:48.440
what is up your sleeve.

22:53.440 --> 22:54.520
With all these stolen

22:54.520 --> 22:55.560
laptops and phones,

22:56.240 --> 22:57.320
you really want to go back to jail?

23:00.000 --> 23:00.800
You already know

23:01.200 --> 23:02.520
how Cao Ping was caught.

23:12.200 --> 23:12.680
Hello?

23:15.440 --> 23:16.120
Mr. Wu, wait,

23:16.320 --> 23:17.520
easy, easy.

23:18.880 --> 23:19.880
Can I take the laptop?

23:19.960 --> 23:20.640
Ok, just take it.

23:25.000 --> 23:25.600
2,000.

23:26.080 --> 23:27.360
You still make a profit.

23:28.320 --> 23:29.120
And you know the rules.

23:31.360 --> 23:31.920
Yes!

23:32.760 --> 23:33.800
Yes, I got it.

23:34.920 --> 23:36.280
Mr. Wu, money settles it.

23:36.800 --> 23:37.400
Take care.

23:59.600 --> 24:00.320
Officer Xu,

24:00.800 --> 24:01.120
Yang Gang's repair shop

24:01.120 --> 24:02.680
is running a shady operation.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.080
You should keep an eye on it.

24:13.320 --> 24:14.560
Auntie, I'm back.

24:17.200 --> 24:18.000
You're back?

24:18.200 --> 24:18.920
I fell asleep.

24:19.280 --> 24:20.720
So, they found the thief?

24:21.280 --> 24:22.360
Kind of...

24:22.640 --> 24:23.720
But we can't tell his face.

24:24.080 --> 24:25.160
You didn't see his face?

24:25.520 --> 24:26.880
Then...How about the laptop?

24:27.880 --> 24:29.600
Well, Officer Xu

24:30.400 --> 24:31.160
said their investigation

24:31.520 --> 24:32.640
still takes some time.

24:35.800 --> 24:36.440
Well then,

24:36.720 --> 24:38.000
just rest our mind now.

24:38.600 --> 24:39.880
At least they are investigating,

24:39.880 --> 24:40.520
aren't they?

24:42.560 --> 24:43.560
This is my laptop.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.520
See?

24:49.680 --> 24:50.920
Zhazhating

24:51.080 --> 24:53.520
is really a blessed place.

24:53.920 --> 24:55.040
Someone did good deeds without a name left.

24:55.040 --> 24:56.080
What a kind guy!

24:56.400 --> 24:57.440
Ok, let's check if it works.

24:57.720 --> 24:58.520
Yes, it works.

25:00.880 --> 25:01.640
I guess,

25:01.680 --> 25:02.680
my good reputation

25:03.040 --> 25:04.400
finally paid off.

25:04.720 --> 25:05.640
They must have known

25:05.640 --> 25:07.280
it was mine,

25:08.040 --> 25:09.760
so they brought it back.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.440
If I ever meet the guy,

25:11.560 --> 25:13.680
I must give him

25:13.720 --> 25:14.960
a thank-you banner.

25:15.400 --> 25:17.760
And at least I will make

25:18.000 --> 25:19.200
three kowtows

25:20.720 --> 25:22.280
to show him

25:22.280 --> 25:25.120
my sincere appreciation.

25:26.600 --> 25:27.520
Have you found the laptop?

25:30.560 --> 25:32.440
Sweetie, you are home!

25:33.320 --> 25:34.640
Yes, we found it.

25:36.760 --> 25:37.920
Since it's back,

25:38.000 --> 25:39.440
I'll go next door.

25:39.600 --> 25:41.160
Don't forget to feed Fortune.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.400
Stop spoiling that Chick.

25:42.440 --> 25:43.280
It's too fat.

25:43.720 --> 25:44.200
I'm leaving.

25:44.240 --> 25:45.800
The skinny one is Chick.

25:58.920 --> 26:00.000
Which one is Fortune?

26:00.000 --> 26:00.840
Which one is Chick?

26:00.840 --> 26:01.720
Can you tell them?

26:03.560 --> 26:04.760
Of course you can't.

26:10.040 --> 26:10.560
This,

26:11.440 --> 26:12.280
the tiny, skinny one,

26:12.720 --> 26:13.240
is Chick.

26:14.240 --> 26:15.000
And this is Blankie.

26:15.880 --> 26:16.680
That's Fortune.

26:24.160 --> 26:25.040
You're hurt.

26:29.200 --> 26:29.720
I'm fine.

26:33.160 --> 26:34.040
Did you find back

26:35.600 --> 26:36.840
my laptop, didn't you?

26:43.800 --> 26:44.600
If you think so,

26:45.520 --> 26:46.280
then yes.

26:50.960 --> 26:51.520
What?

26:52.560 --> 26:53.600
Give me three kowtows?

26:54.960 --> 26:55.800
In your dreams.

27:08.960 --> 27:09.960
[He,]

27:10.720 --> 27:12.360
[is not that bad I've imagined.]

27:32.320 --> 27:32.960
Something wrong?

27:42.240 --> 27:43.560
The medicine from Dr. Zhuang

27:43.560 --> 27:44.120
the other day,

27:44.440 --> 27:45.040
I didn't use it all.

27:45.960 --> 27:46.440
Here.

27:53.040 --> 27:54.360
Just a scratch, I don't need it.

28:09.280 --> 28:09.880
Thank you.

28:13.400 --> 28:14.720
They beat you up,

28:14.720 --> 28:15.880
did you call the police?

28:17.400 --> 28:18.360
I told Officer Xu,

28:18.560 --> 28:19.400
They'll look into it.

29:01.680 --> 29:02.600
Xing Wu,

29:07.520 --> 29:08.520
what brings you here?

29:11.120 --> 29:11.720
For working?

29:13.400 --> 29:14.120
Just a heads up,

29:14.520 --> 29:15.320
don't stand here.

29:16.520 --> 29:17.000
Why?

29:17.520 --> 29:18.280
Am I in your way?

29:21.560 --> 29:22.760
You may get run over.

29:24.240 --> 29:25.520
Stop scaring me.

29:28.600 --> 29:29.400
Believe it or not.

29:29.840 --> 29:30.560
I don't believe it.

29:31.120 --> 29:32.800
Make way! Coming through!

29:49.400 --> 29:50.240
It's my turn.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.000
Give me a lucky tile.

29:52.720 --> 29:53.800
Four Bamboos.

29:55.040 --> 29:55.680
Now my turn.

29:55.680 --> 29:56.520
Oh, yes, sorry, hah.

29:56.520 --> 29:57.680
Stop being funny.

29:59.600 --> 30:00.160
West Wind.

30:00.560 --> 30:01.200
West wind?

30:02.520 --> 30:04.040
Is it the wrong order? Of course, it's me!

30:05.640 --> 30:06.320
One Bamboo.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.000
Auntie,

30:07.400 --> 30:08.080
the Wi-Fi upstairs

30:08.280 --> 30:09.440
keeps cutting out.

30:09.440 --> 30:10.520
Is something wrong with it?

30:10.920 --> 30:12.240
Yeah, the signal is not stable up there.

30:12.240 --> 30:13.520
Go over to the counter.

30:13.520 --> 30:14.320
Unplug the router

30:14.320 --> 30:15.800
and plug it back in.

30:16.920 --> 30:17.520
West wind.

30:34.560 --> 30:35.080
Qing Ye,

30:36.960 --> 30:37.600
the fruit you want!

30:37.760 --> 30:38.800
I went all the way to town for this.

30:39.080 --> 30:40.920
It's my special love for you.

30:41.240 --> 30:43.160
♪I just wanna give you give you love.♪

30:43.160 --> 30:43.800
Stop, stop. Cut it out.

30:44.280 --> 30:45.880
I asked for cherries

30:45.880 --> 30:46.920
and avocados.

30:49.560 --> 30:50.680
You think I'm a fool?

30:51.000 --> 30:52.560
Cherry is cherry.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.960
As for avocados,

30:55.640 --> 30:57.120
I went to two stores, both sold out.

30:57.320 --> 30:57.920
Just eat.

30:57.920 --> 30:58.840
Try these figs.

30:59.000 --> 30:59.760
They are similar,

30:59.960 --> 31:01.240
all fruits. Try one.

31:01.960 --> 31:02.680
Did you...

31:03.000 --> 31:03.600
wash them?

31:04.840 --> 31:05.520
Washed?

31:06.640 --> 31:07.680
Yes, I did.

31:13.080 --> 31:13.680
Well?

31:14.880 --> 31:16.120
local fruit tastes good, huh?

31:17.720 --> 31:18.400
Yes, it's good.

31:19.520 --> 31:20.400
If you like it,

31:20.400 --> 31:21.240
I'll get you some every day.

31:23.440 --> 31:24.160
Kyle!

31:24.160 --> 31:24.600
Just eat!

31:24.720 --> 31:25.560
Come and help!

31:27.000 --> 31:27.520
Ok.

31:27.520 --> 31:28.120
Kyle Hao!

31:28.120 --> 31:29.080
Eat up!

31:30.280 --> 31:31.520
Stop barking!

31:33.960 --> 31:34.520
One Dot.

31:37.040 --> 31:38.640
A good tile, please.

31:39.320 --> 31:40.720
What's this?

31:40.800 --> 31:41.400
Four Bamboos.

31:42.560 --> 31:43.400
Give me a lucky tile.

31:43.400 --> 31:43.920
Qing Ye,

31:44.760 --> 31:45.840
my mom

31:46.280 --> 31:47.400
made this specially for you.

31:50.120 --> 31:50.960
So much?

31:51.040 --> 31:51.760
She said

31:52.080 --> 31:53.440
it's a standard four dishes and soup,

31:53.720 --> 31:54.520
just in half portions.

31:55.320 --> 31:56.040
Are you only in half portions?

31:56.600 --> 31:56.800
Well,

31:57.000 --> 31:58.360
that's a normal portion around here.

31:58.520 --> 31:59.440
Just enjoy your food.

32:01.080 --> 32:01.840
Have some fruit.

32:02.320 --> 32:03.760
The meal is ready,

32:03.880 --> 32:04.760
all ladies!

32:05.400 --> 32:06.720
Thanks, honey.

32:06.760 --> 32:07.960
Finally! I'm starving.

32:08.040 --> 32:08.880
I can't wait.

32:08.880 --> 32:09.680
Hurry up!

32:09.760 --> 32:10.200
Okay!

32:10.680 --> 32:11.440
Don't put it here.

32:12.640 --> 32:13.560
Thanks, my sweetie.

32:14.360 --> 32:15.440
Your mom is in ready hand.

32:15.840 --> 32:16.760
Here, have a try.

32:17.160 --> 32:17.840
Here.

32:21.760 --> 32:23.120
You little Big G,

32:23.240 --> 32:24.800
seemingly innocent,

32:25.040 --> 32:26.200
but you treat us differently!

32:26.520 --> 32:27.000
Look,

32:27.040 --> 32:28.840
the fish balls in your mom's bowl

32:29.160 --> 32:30.000
are more than

32:30.000 --> 32:30.920
the rest of ours combined.

32:31.240 --> 32:31.840
It wasn't me!

32:31.840 --> 32:35.560
My dad made them by hand just now,

32:35.560 --> 32:37.120
so he wants mom to have more.

32:37.240 --> 32:38.120
I see.

32:38.120 --> 32:39.640
Not some discrimination,

32:39.920 --> 32:40.920
but your dad's special love

32:40.920 --> 32:42.920
to your mom.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.840
Just eat!

32:45.840 --> 32:46.960
Take some to Grandma.

32:47.040 --> 32:48.240
Grandma, the meal's ready.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.080
Whose turn? Whose turn?

32:49.080 --> 32:49.600
Who's up?

32:49.600 --> 32:50.280
Me, me, me. My turn.

32:50.280 --> 32:50.840
Hurry!

32:51.920 --> 32:52.840
A lucky tile, seven Bamboos.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.080
Don't interrupt.

32:54.080 --> 32:54.600
Hey,

32:54.600 --> 32:56.160
just play it!

32:56.160 --> 32:56.800
What are you doing?

32:56.800 --> 32:57.880
Go away! Go do your chores.

32:59.920 --> 33:00.360
Bye!

33:00.360 --> 33:01.240
Don't forget your medicine.

33:01.440 --> 33:02.520
Mom, remember to eat.

33:02.520 --> 33:03.040
Big G,

33:03.920 --> 33:05.360
is there any other specialties

33:05.600 --> 33:07.200
in Zhazhating?

33:08.800 --> 33:09.240
Yes!

33:09.240 --> 33:10.520
Of course.

33:17.520 --> 33:18.600
What are these?

33:18.600 --> 33:19.680
These clouds of toppings!

33:20.680 --> 33:22.640
Our special Zhazhating drink,

33:23.400 --> 33:24.080
Zhazha Drink.

33:24.800 --> 33:25.360
Delicious!

33:32.120 --> 33:32.680
Not bad.

33:33.000 --> 33:33.400
Here.

33:34.160 --> 33:35.600
Try some local skewers.

33:35.800 --> 33:36.520
Zhazha skewer!

33:43.120 --> 33:43.600
How is it?

33:43.800 --> 33:44.600
It's also good.

33:44.760 --> 33:45.240
I told you.

33:46.240 --> 33:46.720
Quite good.

33:49.320 --> 33:49.800
By the way,

33:50.560 --> 33:51.720
why did Xing Wu drop out?

33:52.160 --> 33:53.360
He dropped out long ago.

33:53.840 --> 33:55.000
He's been working for two years.

33:55.440 --> 33:55.800
He

33:56.440 --> 33:57.760
left school in senior year.

33:59.040 --> 33:59.520
But his mom

33:59.520 --> 34:01.160
kept his enrolment open.

34:02.640 --> 34:03.720
Wu has to make money.

34:04.400 --> 34:05.520
A family of three,

34:05.640 --> 34:06.440
plus Liu Nian,

34:07.160 --> 34:08.280
all depend on him.

34:10.360 --> 34:11.239
In a word, he's

34:11.679 --> 34:12.120
awesome.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.040
Really?

34:15.520 --> 34:16.719
He's got brains and brawn.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.239
He can fix anything,

34:18.520 --> 34:19.400
and he's the most loyal guy ever.

34:20.040 --> 34:20.679
A real brother.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.120
As the man of the house.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.880
he's responsible.

34:25.679 --> 34:26.639
Simply put,

34:26.719 --> 34:28.400
he's the most capable guy

34:28.520 --> 34:29.440
in this whole town.

34:31.840 --> 34:33.360
So he's a local specialty too?

34:34.080 --> 34:34.800
No, he is not a loser.

34:35.960 --> 34:36.840
How good can he be?

34:37.280 --> 34:38.199
Can he fly or something?

34:39.080 --> 34:39.719
Actually, yeah.

34:39.920 --> 34:41.000
Wu almost made it.

34:41.120 --> 34:43.199
The model planes he built flew so high.

34:43.560 --> 34:45.040
He used to be a straight-A student.

34:45.199 --> 34:46.360
Right after the senior year started,

34:46.440 --> 34:47.239
he suddenly dropped out

34:48.080 --> 34:49.120
with no choice.

34:49.280 --> 34:50.880
The teacher and Aunt Lanfang

34:50.920 --> 34:51.960
both wanted him back.

34:52.320 --> 34:53.320
If it weren't for what happened...

34:53.320 --> 34:54.199
Kyle,

34:54.639 --> 34:56.120
stop talking nonsense.

34:56.400 --> 34:57.600
Didn't Wu tell you

34:57.600 --> 34:58.520
not to spread his things around?

34:59.600 --> 35:01.400
But she is part of the family.

35:02.440 --> 35:03.640
If it weren't for two years ago...

35:07.520 --> 35:08.040
If you're curious,

35:08.040 --> 35:08.760
just ask him by yourself.

35:10.040 --> 35:11.000
Actually I don't care.

35:12.320 --> 35:13.800
Who...Whose computer?

35:14.280 --> 35:15.680
Zhao Pock, what are you doing?

35:15.680 --> 35:17.280
Water is spilled on her laptop!

35:17.680 --> 35:18.120
It's fine.

35:18.120 --> 35:18.640
Hurry!

35:18.680 --> 35:19.680
Just a little water.

35:20.480 --> 35:21.280
What's wrong? What...?

35:23.360 --> 35:24.200
Hand me my computer.

35:24.600 --> 35:25.000
I...

35:25.120 --> 35:26.400
I haven't even registered for classes!

35:30.520 --> 35:31.640
It didn't work.

35:31.920 --> 35:32.680
It's all wet.

35:32.960 --> 35:33.920
It's fine, just a little water.

35:33.960 --> 35:34.960
I can wipe it down

35:35.080 --> 35:36.400
and blow-dry it.

35:36.520 --> 35:37.040
Don't touch it!

35:37.160 --> 35:38.920
She needs that for studying abroad.

35:39.760 --> 35:40.600
I was just pouring a glass of water.

35:40.600 --> 35:41.440
I didn't mean to

35:41.440 --> 35:42.160
break her laptop.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.080
That serious?

35:43.640 --> 35:44.680
I'll pay for the repair.

35:45.320 --> 35:47.920
It is a high-end laptop.

35:48.200 --> 35:50.240
It may cost thousands.

35:52.040 --> 35:52.920
So expensive?

35:53.960 --> 35:54.920
Look what you did.

35:55.280 --> 35:57.520
Maybe Wu can help with it?

35:57.600 --> 35:58.880
Yeah, Xing Wu can fix it.

35:58.960 --> 35:59.560
You...

35:59.760 --> 36:01.120
Is there any official repair service here?

36:01.200 --> 36:01.920
Service centre? No.

36:02.280 --> 36:02.920
No idea.

36:03.040 --> 36:04.160
We don't have that here.

36:04.680 --> 36:05.120
Then,

36:05.520 --> 36:06.440
where is the nearest

36:06.440 --> 36:07.120
repair shop?

36:07.680 --> 36:08.760
At the Second Bridge.

36:08.920 --> 36:09.520
Ok, I'll go there.

36:09.520 --> 36:10.920
Qing...

36:20.600 --> 36:21.080
Sir,

36:21.280 --> 36:22.000
can you take me to the Second Bridge?

36:23.200 --> 36:23.760
Hey,

36:24.080 --> 36:24.720
we've met again.

36:25.080 --> 36:25.560
Yes, I can.

36:25.880 --> 36:26.320
Come on.

36:26.680 --> 36:27.120
By the way,

36:27.440 --> 36:28.440
please take me

36:28.880 --> 36:29.720
to the best

36:29.720 --> 36:30.600
repair shop here.

36:30.840 --> 36:32.280
You picked the right person.

36:32.520 --> 36:33.720
Hold on, put this helmet on.

36:45.040 --> 36:47.360
♪Let me accept...♪

36:53.760 --> 36:54.240
Sir,

36:54.920 --> 36:56.520
can you please hurry up?

36:56.800 --> 36:57.720
Young lady,

36:58.280 --> 36:59.360
you can't

36:59.440 --> 37:01.040
always rush.

37:01.440 --> 37:03.400
Sometimes you gotta stop

37:03.880 --> 37:05.640
and enjoy the view.

37:05.640 --> 37:06.440
What do you think?

37:08.160 --> 37:09.640
I'll pay you double.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.720
It's not about money.

37:11.880 --> 37:13.280
I wasn't even gonna charge you.

37:14.360 --> 37:16.160
I'm in a hurry, sir.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.760
It's really important.

37:18.080 --> 37:18.800
Important?

37:19.200 --> 37:20.600
Why didn't you say so?

37:20.760 --> 37:21.520
Hold on!

37:22.360 --> 37:22.960
Here we go!

37:38.080 --> 37:39.200
Here we are.

37:39.680 --> 37:42.120
Go to Sniper King for repairs.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.320
Sniper King?

37:44.360 --> 37:45.360
Trust me.

37:45.560 --> 37:46.000
Go on.

37:47.240 --> 37:47.720
Thank you!

37:47.800 --> 37:48.240
You're welcome.

37:57.720 --> 37:58.240
Hi.

38:10.760 --> 38:11.320
Welcome here.

38:14.360 --> 38:15.080
Who are you looking for?

38:16.040 --> 38:17.000
Are you the Sniper King?

38:18.000 --> 38:18.760
I want to get my laptop fixed.

38:19.920 --> 38:20.720
Oh, Sniper King.

38:21.720 --> 38:22.520
Hey, Sniper!

38:23.000 --> 38:23.760
Someone's here for you.

38:24.600 --> 38:25.160
Come in.

38:25.560 --> 38:26.160
Look at this...

38:36.200 --> 38:37.320
Are you the Sniper?

38:42.160 --> 38:42.840
What's up?

38:44.360 --> 38:44.920
You know each other?

38:45.440 --> 38:46.080
Then, Wu...

38:46.080 --> 38:47.280
I'll come back when it's fixed.

38:47.920 --> 38:48.440
Bye.

38:49.040 --> 38:49.520
Ok.

38:53.760 --> 38:54.400
What's wrong?

38:55.640 --> 38:57.080
Water damage. It went black.

38:57.760 --> 38:59.320
The tricycle driver said you can fix it.

39:06.800 --> 39:08.520
Stolen yesterday, drowned today.

39:08.840 --> 39:10.320
This laptop has terrible luck with you.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.440
Nothing's gone right since I got here.

39:37.760 --> 39:38.920
Why are you tearing it apart?

39:38.920 --> 39:39.840
Can you really fix it?

39:39.840 --> 39:41.040
Don't wreck it.

39:51.000 --> 39:51.680
Relax.

39:56.560 --> 39:57.240
Wipe your sweat.

39:59.720 --> 40:00.520
Don't get it on my workbench.

40:50.280 --> 40:51.760
Don't worry. Have some water.

40:53.720 --> 40:54.680
Just leave it to Sniper.

40:57.040 --> 40:57.760
I'm Quanya,

40:58.280 --> 40:59.080
Wu's buddy

40:59.280 --> 41:00.000
and sort of his boss.

41:01.760 --> 41:02.600
I'm Qing Ye.

41:03.000 --> 41:03.640
Thanks.

41:04.680 --> 41:05.520
You can totally

41:05.680 --> 41:06.400
trust his skills.

41:17.280 --> 41:18.040
How is it looking?

41:19.120 --> 41:20.400
A capacitor on the motherboard was fried.

41:21.040 --> 41:21.600
Need replacement.

41:22.560 --> 41:24.080
Can it be done by ten tonight?

41:24.080 --> 41:24.840
I really need it.

41:25.240 --> 41:26.040
It's Ok,

41:26.520 --> 41:27.160
but it'll cost.

41:28.040 --> 41:28.680
Price isn't an issue.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.440
just fix it.

41:30.680 --> 41:31.440
Will my files

41:31.440 --> 41:32.440
be saved?

41:32.800 --> 41:33.440
It depends, not sure.

41:38.280 --> 41:38.800
What?

41:39.800 --> 41:40.520
got rich again?

41:40.960 --> 41:41.560
None of your business.

41:42.080 --> 41:43.120
I'll transfer the room fee

41:43.240 --> 41:44.000
to you, too.

41:50.800 --> 41:51.640
Where are you going?

41:51.840 --> 41:53.360
Do you want this fixed or not?

41:54.520 --> 41:56.240
The spare parts are on Xuan Island.

41:56.920 --> 41:58.520
If you're coming, follow me.

42:06.080 --> 42:07.000
They're out.

42:18.440 --> 42:18.920
Put it on.

42:19.840 --> 42:21.120
How am I supposed to sit on this?

42:24.520 --> 42:25.120
Hey, what are you looking at?

42:25.800 --> 42:26.720
My bad, my bad.

42:31.000 --> 42:31.560
Get on.

42:32.080 --> 42:32.560
I...

43:03.240 --> 43:04.040
Tie this on.

43:31.320 --> 43:32.040
Do you need help?

43:32.320 --> 43:33.400
No, I got it.
